5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. To start, I think I would like to look into the county grant terms and the endowment, and the winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the attendance sheets from former outreach stops and those two programmes begun six years ago!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe I shall examine the running and equipment lines from last year, as well as the county grant terms and the endowment.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I believe we have a very comprehensive list started. Does anyone feel we are missing a perspective, or are you all satisfied with your choices for now?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am satisfied. I think we have covered the logistical and financial bases quite well.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm satisfied too! I just want to know what happened before so we don't make the same mistakes again.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I agree with Rin. A touch of historical context often prevents us from repeating the same elegant failures. I am quite content with our current selections.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I am also satisfied. We have a balanced approach between current capacity and historical data.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Since we are all in agreement, perhaps we can move forward. I feel a sense of peace knowing we are all looking for the truth together.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,Me too! I can't wait to see what's in those old files!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the anticipation is half the fun. I shall await the findings with a measured curiosity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us proceed to the research phase so we can bring these facts back to the table.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I believe we have said all that needs to be said for this round. I am ready to see what the records reveal.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I believe we have a solid plan and can now move to the investigation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! Let's go find out what happened!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Let us step away from the conversation for a moment and let the archives speak to us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. I am ready to review the documents and return with the facts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
